{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:03.64] Oh-uh\n[00:03.92] Oh (Danny, I see you)\n[00:05.06] Wouldn't wanna be you\n[Verse 1]\n[00:06.14] I think these drugs really startin' to affect my mood swings (For real)\n[00:09.32] And the way I do things (For real)\n[00:10.64] Sometimes I feel like Bruce Wayne (Uh-huh), sometimes I feel like Liu Kang, Like I could beat any nigga ass (Uh-huh)\n[00:16.00] What is you sayin'? You know we shoot thangs, gang (Brrah-brrah-brrah)\n[00:20.08] Go 'head, touch on this bulge in my pants, gimmie an erection (C'mon baby)\n[00:22.78] Don't do that shit when we in the club, 'cause that's my Smith & Wesson (Brrah-brrah)\n[00:27.22] I'ma leave his block with a message (Braow-braow-braow)\n[00:29.96] Gon' head grab the extended clip, go and fill it up with hollow tips (Yeah)\n[00:33.40] I ain't no anti-violence kid, I keep them bitches in self-defense (Facts)\n[00:36.60] I mean, come on, it's a brick on my wrist (Yeah)\n[00:37.96] All these diamonds be dancin', they jealous of it (Gleam, gleam)\n[00:39.86] \"Jesus, I think he at it again\" (Uh)\n[00:41.22] Got an AP on AP, no Patekin' him (Uh-huh)\n[00:43.12] Say you want smoke wit' lil' ole me, I'ma feed you to my savages then, yeah, huh (C'mon)\n[00:47.00] Got a habit to keep automatics (I do)\n[00:48.66] I'ma stash 'em up under my mattress (I do)\n[00:50.26] Bring 'em out when the opps wanna battle (Come on)\n[00:51.90] Bring 'em out when the rats wanna tattle (Come on)\n[00:53.56] He a snake, yeah, I know it, he rattled (He a snake)\n[00:55.20] All this Wock', I'ma drop in a Snapple (Uh-huh)\n[00:56.88] I be high, I don't beef with no rappers (Go)\n[00:58.50] Never leavin' my brothers, it's tatted on me\n[01:00.12] Hit the streets if you want my credentials (That's facts)\n[01:01.80] Everybody know Kyro now, I call him up, we put shots at yo' mental (What up bro?)\n[01:05.04] We push up in the coupe that go 200, even though everyone in it is 150 (On Vito)\n[01:08.30] Drop the price on my wrist, it was 200\n[01:09.96] Plus a few hundred more, if you get me (Yeah)\n[01:11.64] Then I went put a watch on my Mrs. (Uh)\n[01:13.16] It was the talk of the town, couldn't miss it (Uh-huh)\n[01:14.78] What I'm tryna say is, get realistic (Uh-huh)\n[01:16.46] I'm really rich, you niggas is richless (Uh-huh)\n[01:18.16] I spent yo' rent on my family Christmas (Uh-huh)\n[01:19.80] I got everything that was on they wishlist (For real)\n[01:21.50] Yeah, and don't go broke tryna prove me wrong\n[01:23.40] For your sake, I wouldn't risk it (Bitch)\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.86] My wave, they gon' ride, yeah, ride, yeah, ride (Ride)\n[01:27.94] She wanna get in my ride, yeah, ride, yeah, ride (Ride)\n[01:31.38] I do not comply, no comply, no comply (Comply)\n[01:34.12] Why? 'Cause I'm way too high, but shit, get inside (C'mon baby)\n[01:37.70] Buckle up, let's go for a ride (Yeah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:39.44] Hop in a spaceship\n[01:40.24] Police try to follow, I'm too evasive (Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:42.16] Codeine baby bottles, I've been abusive (Yeah)\n[01:43.52] Brand-new Diablo, 'member Monte Carlo\n[01:45.22] Now I'm swervin', listening to my music (Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:47.52] Kids rage-rage-rage-rage to it (Yeah), last night too high, couldn't do it (Yeah)\n[01:50.20] I just be overly under the influence\n[01:52.14] But I'm in my zone, E.T. phone when I'm on my way home\n[01:54.78] My main thing just got a new thong, seen her put it on, so I did her all night long\n[01:57.74] Next night in the studio all night long\n[01:59.62] On that mic, I can't do wrong (Uh)\n[02:01.24] Off of them Percs, make drug songs\n[02:02.90] Off of them Percs, make love songs (What else?)\n[02:04.56] Off of them Percs, make thug songs (What else?)\n[02:06.52] Totin' them gun songs (What else?)\n[02:08.00] \"I could fuck yo' mom\" songs (What else?)\n[02:09.46] Osama bin Laden, \"I'm the bomb\" songs\n[02:11.06] Talking with diamonds in my mouth, conversations while I floss\n[02:14.40] Dinner re